target:    readme.txt
gate:      composer test:db-floor-metadata
kind:      restore-defect
expect:    has no `= 6.1.3 =` entry under `== Upgrade Notice ==`
rationale: Moves the current Upgrade Notice entry under == Changelog == with a dateless heading; a whole-file search still finds it, only section-scoped extraction rejects it.
---
--- a/readme.txt
+++ b/readme.txt
@@ -167,5 +167,2 @@
 == Upgrade Notice ==
-
-= 6.1.3 =
-Older versions keep working, added columns stay, and it removes no rows. Fixes inflated Human Visits from server tracking, Dashboard filter links, multi-line Heatmaps page lists, and a security issue in the Access Log user-agent tooltip.
 
@@ -180,2 +177,5 @@
 
+= 6.1.3 =
+Older versions keep working, added columns stay, and it removes no rows. Fixes inflated Human Visits from server tracking, Dashboard filter links, multi-line Heatmaps page lists, and a security issue in the Access Log user-agent tooltip.
+
 = 6.1.3 - 2026-11-20 =
